Mark Healey wrote:

> Orcus killed my monk (not really the third, but the third I didn't
> consider disposable).  Anyway, How do you kill the bastard?  There was
> no way I was going to get back to the stairs I came in on.  It wasn't
> so much the hitting but the monsters he surrounded me with.  He seems
> to be sleep, magic missle, and lightning imune.  It doesn't help that
> I lost about 6 levels on the way.  Going weaponless is a bitch, no
> projectiles, so the Wraiths and Vamps got me.  There were too many to
